# Play ViZDoom My Way Home

Navigate the maze and reach the green armor vest before the episode times out.
The labyrinth contains differently colored interconnected rooms and a dead-end
corridor. The vest remains in the same destination room, but your starting
room and facing direction are random.

Use the ViZDoom MCP tools to interact with the episode:

- Call `get_current_state` first. It returns the current screen, valid button
  names, and episode metadata.
- Call `make_action` with a JSON list named `buttons`. You may press multiple
  buttons together; an empty list waits. Every call advances four frames and
  returns the resulting state and screen.

Use only names listed in `available_buttons`. Continue until a tool result
reports `done: true`. Reaching the vest is success; the decision limit or a
timeout is failure.

Do not use the internet or access the game by any route other than the
provided ViZDoom MCP tools. Built-in web search and web fetch are disabled.
